Modified vendored file: vendor/tesseract/tesseract.min.js, worker.min.js
----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Modified from the upstream tesseract.js distribution: removed fallback
URLs pointing to the jsDelivr CDN (remote code is prohibited by browser
extension policies). The extension always supplies local worker/core/lang
paths explicitly, so these unused defaults are now local-relative paths.


